     solver, job 1365191), RsdTarget 1e-10;
  2. QOP_CLOVER_MULTIGRID_INVERTER on the unpreconditioned clover action (the LinOp solver takes the full
     source; on the even-odd action chroma hands it a source whose even sites are not set), Residual 1e-10,
     the 16^3 blocking of qopmg_validate_hmc16_qopmg.ini.xml, its own subspace.
Pass: every "QOPMG_LINOP_SOLVER: ... Relative Rsd" below 1e-10 x 5 (the residual is computed with chroma's
operator, so this checks QOP's kappa, clover and boundary conventions and the gauge import); the QOP
"QDP: Average plaquette" equals chroma's w_plaq printed just before it; the two prop_corr arrays in the
output XML agree to about 1e-9 relative on every timeslice.
Run on one lq3 node, 4 ranks x 16 threads, -geom 1 1 1 4 (local 16 16 16 12).
</annotation>
